(Hong Kong) Ltd., Apache-2.0. Modifications: a new `oracle-internals`
feature exposing the crate-private lottery, dense-mapping and batch-path
checks to the differential oracle. No verification code changes.
Apply with `patch -p1` inside the unpacked crate.

